# M1_limitation_slowmanifold_HH.xps -- runs M1_limitation_slowmanifold_HH.ode in one go (the steps at the top of the .ode).
#   XPPAUT 8.4:  File > Do script > M1_limitation_slowmanifold_HH.xps    (or: xppaut M1_limitation_slowmanifold_HH.ode -script M1_limitation_slowmanifold_HH.xps)
#   XPPAUT-Web:  pick it under Scripts (group iso-test), or open the link with ?script=
speed 0.3
msg "M1 along the repelling slow manifold: 800 starting points at v = -55 (a slice and three zooms into a layer); a minute or two"
keys v 2
ans X-axis=vs|Y-axis=ns|Xmin=-90|Ymin=0.3|Xmax=52|Ymax=0.8|Xlabel=v|Ylabel=n
keys u c a
ans theta
ans c
ans 0
ans 1
keys esc
keys n n
keys i r
ans Range over=j|Steps=799|Start=0|End=799|Reset storage (Y/N)=N|Use old ic's (Y/N)=Y|Cycle color (Y/N)=N|Movie(Y/N)=N
msg "The colour jumps where the slice meets a thin layer next to the V-nullcline (n = 0.432617). Next: three zooms, each in a new window"
wait 4
keys m c
keys u c a
ans theta
ans c
ans 0
ans 1
keys esc
keys v 2
ans X-axis=z4|Y-axis=theta|Xmin=-1|Ymin=0|Xmax=1|Ymax=1|Xlabel=(n-0.432617)*1e4|Ylabel=phase
keys r
msg "Zoom 10^4: phase against position across the layer (spacing 1e-06 in n); the stack at 0 = the finer zooms, spread out in the next window"
wait 3
keys m c
keys u c a
ans theta
ans c
ans 0
ans 1
keys esc
keys v 2
ans X-axis=z8|Y-axis=theta|Xmin=-1|Ymin=0|Xmax=1|Ymax=1|Xlabel=(n-0.432617)*1e8|Ylabel=phase
keys r
msg "Zoom 10^8: phase against position across the layer (spacing 1e-10 in n); the stack at 0 = the finer zooms, spread out in the next window"
wait 3
keys m c
keys u c a
ans theta
ans c
ans 0
ans 1
keys esc
keys v 2
ans X-axis=z11|Y-axis=theta|Xmin=-1|Ymin=0|Xmax=1|Ymax=1|Xlabel=(n-0.432617)*1e11|Ylabel=phase
keys r
msg "Zoom 10^11: phase against position across the layer (spacing 1e-13 in n)"
wait 3
msg "Done. M1's limitation: even at a spacing of 1e-13 in n the phase still jumps by 0.3; no practical grid resolves this layer."
